    <string name="macrodroid_instructions"><![CDATA[<b>Setup Instructions:</b><br><br>
1. On the <b>ScreenMate Receiver</b> device, install <b>MacroDroid</b> and create a new Macro.<br><br>
2. Add a <b>Trigger</b>: \"Connectivity\" -> \"Web Hook (HTTP)\". Choose an ID (e.g. \"nav\").<br><br>
3. MacroDroid will provide a URL. Copy it and paste it in the field below.<br><br>
4. Add a <b>Variable</b> to the Macro: name it <b>\"value\"</b> (type String).<br><br>
5. Add an <b>Action</b>: \"Device Actions\" -> \"Send Intent\".<br><br>
6. Configure Intent: Action: <b>android.intent.action.VIEW</b>, Data: <b>{lv=value}</b>, Target: <b>Activity</b>.]]></string>

    <string name="ntfy_config">ntfy.sh Configuration</string>
