    <string name="save_ntfy">Save ntfy</string>
    <string name="ntfy_instructions"><![CDATA[<b>Pairing Steps:</b><br><br>
1. On the <b>ScreenMate Receiver</b> device, click \"Generate Topic and Key\".<br><br>
2. On this device, click <b>\"Scan Receiver QR\"</b> and point at the code on the Receiver screen.<br><br>
3. The apps will pair instantly with E2E encryption support.]]></string>

